k*(kS' - (kL - qS)) = kappa**2*Derivative(L(kappa), (kappa, 2)) + 2*kappa*q*Derivative(L(kappa), kappa) - q**2 + q + (-kappa**2 + q**2 - q)*L(kappa)
third-order ODE: k^2 L''' + (2q+2) k L'' + (q(q+1) - k^2) L' - 2k L = 0  (verified)
H' + (3m + (2q+2)/k) H = Delta(m,k)  with Delta = -k m(1-m^2) + (2q+5)m^2 - 2 + (q+1)(q+2)m/k  (verified)
hence (k^{2q+2} L^3 H)' = k^{2q+2} L^3 Delta(m(k),k)
